# Knowledge base source documents (personal/copyrighted — never commit)
RAGloader/content/**
!RAGloader/content/README.md
# Exception: FinBuddy's own original knowledge-base write-ups (glossary,
# fund categories, SEBI summary, strategy explainers) are not personal or
# copyrighted third-party material — keep them versioned so the team and
# the grader can see exactly what was ingested.
!RAGloader/content/text/
!RAGloader/content/text/*.md

# Jupyter checkpoint clutter (created automatically when a notebook is opened)
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/

